# Never commit Nintendo Account credentials or nxapi data.
# nxapi stores session tokens in ~/Library/Application Support/nxapi-nodejs (macOS) by default;
# these patterns guard against accidentally using a data path inside this repository.
.env
.env.*
nxapi-data/
nxapi-nodejs/
data/
*.session
*session_token*
*session-token*
*.secret
secrets/
